    "Name": "J.Edgar (M-RE)",
    "Details": "Designed with combined arms tactics in mind, the 25 ton J. Edgar (M-RE) is equipped to counter the exotic armor types in use among the DCMS. Powered by the classic 145-rated Fusion Core and covered in 5.5 tons of Heavy Ferro-Fibrous armor, the tank is armed with a Medium Re-Engineered Laser and a pair of Streak SRM-2 (I-OS). A Bloodhound Active Probe improves the Tanks scouting abilities.\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Biome Restrictions: None.</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Movement: 11/17 hexes / 330/510 meters.</color></b>\n\n<color=#ffcc00><b>Armor:</b> Heavy Ferro-Fibrous\n<b>Structure:</b> Structure\n<b>Values       A        S  </b>\n<b>Front</b>       155     15\n<b>Left</b>         110     15\n<b>Right</b>       110     15\n<b>Rear</b>         80     15\n<b>Turret</b>      130     15\n\n<b>Total</b>      585     75</color>\n\n<color=#ff0000>Quirk: Accurate Weapon - Laser</color>",
    "Icon": "J.edgar"
  },
